# Derived screenshot decks. Every file the deck slots address is a
# byte-identical copy of one under captures/, renumbered into position by
# tool/collect.mjs. captures/ is the source of truth; tracking both stored the
# same ~31MB of PNG twice. Rebuild the served tree with:
#   node tool/collect.mjs captures/iphone  iphone
#   node tool/collect.mjs captures/ipad    ipad
#   node tool/collect.mjs captures/android android
# uploaded/ is exempt: those come from the editor's drop target, not from a
# capture, so nothing can regenerate them and they must stay in git.
public/screenshots/*
!public/screenshots/uploaded/
